   "id": "cee9dd4c-b155-4b4a-8393-92026e9e4246",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 11. Train Model 2: Support Vector Machine (SVM)\n",
    "\n",
    "Support Vector Machine is used as the second classification model. SVM can capture more complex decision boundaries than Logistic Regression."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 16,
   "id": "c64a8e7d-a453-480a-9b2d-a775821163e5",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "svm_model = Pipeline(steps=[\n",
    "    (\"preprocessor\", preprocessor),\n",
    "    (\"classifier\", SVC())])\n",
    "\n",
    "svm_model.fit(X_train, y_train)\n",
    "\n",
    "y_pred_svm = svm_model.predict(X_test)"
   ]
